step Neutral to Friendly
  tip After the Shipping Label, Friendly is 1000 more: 14 Journeyman writs, 8 Expert or 5 Artisan. Expert and Artisan customers are mostly not in Polestar's data yet: follow the mark the quest puts on your map. Journeyman envelopes drop from mobs of about level 11 to 31; Expert and Artisan ones from higher mobs.
  rep 2586 Friendly only Alliance
  rep 2587 Friendly only Horde

