step Friendly to Honored
  tip Friendly opens the first gated recipes at the camp's profession vendors (Tailoring 25, Leatherworking 17, Enchanting 13, Blacksmithing 10, Engineering 10, Alchemy 5, Cooking 2) and the Uncertified Scribe: Dianne Softstep at Three Corners, Kurvelk Shadowhoof at the south end of the Crossroads camp. The scribe's Forged Delivery Receipt (15 Merchant's Favor) turns an empty Waylaid Crate into a Notarized Shipping Container; hand it to Marcy Baker or Dokimi for 50 reputation (Crate Return). Any crate works, so buy the cheapest one the Auction House has. Honored is 6000 more: 80 Journeyman writs, 48 Expert, 30 Artisan, or 120 crate returns (1,800 Favor and 120 crates). Mix both: every writ you can fill, returns with spare Favor. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain.
  rep 2586 Honored only Alliance
  rep 2587 Honored only Horde
  buy 262902 npc 256742 optional only Alliance          -- Forged Delivery Receipt, 15 Merchant's Favor
  buy 262902 npc 256672 optional only Horde             -- Forged Delivery Receipt, 15 Merchant's Favor
  turnin 93862 direct npc 256390 optional only Alliance -- Crate Return: 50 reputation
  turnin 93862 direct npc 256386 optional only Horde    -- Crate Return: 50 reputation

step Badlands writ customer
  when onquest 94256
  zone Badlands
  tip Lotwil Veriatus works about 550 yards east of Kargath. He is the only Expert customer Polestar's data knows.
  turnin 94256 npc 2921                       -- Frost Protection Potion, 125 reputation

step Honored to Revered
  tip Honored opens the rest of the gated recipes (Leatherworking 28, Blacksmithing 21, Enchanting 16, Alchemy 15, Engineering 9, Tailoring 6, Cooking 1), the Advertising License Application (1,200 Favor from Tamelyn Aldridge or Gishah: it starts the quest for a Tradeskill Sign toy) and the scribe's Forger's Quill (15 Favor), which swaps a writ you cannot fill for a random one of the same rank. Revered is 12000 more: 160 Journeyman writs, 96 Expert, 60 Artisan, or 240 crate returns (3,600 Favor). Forever's quest data sets no standing limit on Journeyman writs: their customers are the ones in the zone steps above.
  rep 2586 Revered only Alliance
  rep 2587 Revered only Horde
  buy 270888 npc 256389 optional only Alliance          -- Advertising License Application, 1,200 Merchant's Favor
  buy 270887 npc 256384 optional only Horde             -- Advertising License Application, 1,200 Merchant's Favor
  turnin 93862 direct npc 256390 optional only Alliance -- Crate Return: 50 reputation
  turnin 93862 direct npc 256386 optional only Horde    -- Crate Return: 50 reputation

step Revered to Exalted
  tip Revered opens the Packmule Treat, the Minimule pet (1,500 Favor from Tamelyn Aldridge or Gishah). Exalted is 21000 more: 280 Journeyman writs, 168 Expert, 105 Artisan, or 420 crate returns (6,300 Favor). Keep 6,000 Favor for the Pack Kodo if you want it.
  rep 2586 Exalted only Alliance
  rep 2587 Exalted only Horde
  buy 284664 npc 256389 optional only Alliance          -- Packmule Treat, 1,500 Merchant's Favor
  buy 284664 npc 256384 optional only Horde             -- Packmule Treat, 1,500 Merchant's Favor
  turnin 93862 direct npc 256390 optional only Alliance -- Crate Return: 50 reputation
  turnin 93862 direct npc 256386 optional only Horde    -- Crate Return: 50 reputation

step Exalted
  tip Exalted opens the camp's tabard (200 Favor) at Tamelyn Aldridge or Gishah, and the Reins of the Pack Kodo (6,000 Favor; the mount needs level 60 and Journeyman mount training) at Huey Sunnydale in Three Corners or Okamache at the Crossroads camp. The Pack Kodo guide under Collectibles leads you there.
  buy 262765 npc 256389 only Alliance                   -- Azeroth Commerce Authority Tabard, 200 Merchant's Favor
  buy 262764 npc 256384 only Horde                      -- Durotar Supply and Logistics Tabard, 200 Merchant's Favor
